=2 Walkthrough
* Head to {z:Lower Delkfutt's Tower} in {z:Qufim Island} for a cutscene and the beginning of Chapter 1.
* Zone into {z:Upper Jeuno} for another cutscene.
* Go to the Infirmary in {z:Upper Jeuno} (G-10) near Home Point #3 to speak with {n:Monberaux}.
* After the cutscene, you will receive the {@k} {k:Mysterious amulet|Mysterious amulet (1)}.

=2 Postponing
* If you chose to postpone the starting scenario, the mission "To Start CoP..." will appear in your mission log.
* Use the **Tales' Beginning** book at {z:Lower Delkfutt's Tower} (H-10) to start the Mission.
** The {p:Tales' Beginning} book can only be seen visually in-game or on the map by the player(s) who set their story on hold.

